OL,3,GNEWSA'Shoplifting epidemic puts my
OL,4,Alivelihood at stake'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile shoplifting cases have seen a dip
OL,7,Fof 5% across England, in Cleveland
OL,8,FPolice's force area they are going up.
OL,9,FA shopkeeper in Stockton-on-Tees shares
OL,10,Fhow his business is coping.
OL,12,FIt is a fairly normal weekday morning
OL,13,Fat Addison Newsagents on Church Road in
OL,14,FStockton-on-Tees.
OL,16,FRegular customers are dropping in to
OL,17,Fpick up newspapers and drop off parcels
OL,18,Fand checking in on each other, asking
OL,19,Fabout plans for the day.
OL,21,FDespite the community feel, this shop
OL,22,Ffaces its problems.
